+Record node identity, region ownership, installed modules, power/cooling links, defenses, storage, capabilities and regime state. Upgrades can unlock machines, recipes, agent roles, transport and expeditions. Removing a dependency pauses or reroutes current capabilities with intelligible feedback, preserving history.
