+### 10.1 Traversal layers
+
+Explore on foot with switchable camera views; use built routes and hardware structures; ride coolant flumes, board terrain and cable bundles. Coolant geography is recognizably V240-inspired but expanded into playable conduits, channels, service chambers and reservoirs. This is not an asserted exact model of the actual installed sealed cooler.
