+
+Fabricate and salvage vehicles and parts, add burst boost through fictional stored energy, customize lighting/horns, and develop utility/combat/cargo equipment. Radio concepts are Sub-Bass Bus, Clock-Cycle FM and Process Chatter. Track sources, audio production and licensing have not been selected. Adam's proposed stunt commentary remains newly authored game dialogue, not historical quotations.
