+Core/platform: lifecycle, time, native surfaces, input, jobs, cancellation, errors and diagnostics. Renderer: device, resources, shaders, materials, lights, cameras, passes and safe presentation. World: identity, components, transforms, scenes, prefab instances and events. Physics: collision, characters, constraints and vehicle integration. Assets: import/cook/dependency/loading contracts. Audio/UI/animation: player presentation and authorable bindings.
