+## 17. Visual and audio direction
+
+The primary direction combines intricate computer materials with cinematic, readable miniature-scale traversal. Graphite PCB, metallic frames, gold contacts and copper channels contrast restored warm illumination against faction-specific corruption. The 4090 FE silhouette and board/chassis landmarks anchor orientation.
+
+Amber light is a proposed visual expression of Adam's remembered guidance; it is not an invented portrait or claim of physical presence. His visual representation remains open. Supplied art can vary style while supporting interiors, combat, scale and functional building.
+
+Sounds include fans, power, mechanical activity, flowing coolant, spatial conduit cues, vehicle systems and restrained musical motifs. Adam's voice is close and intelligible; personal characterization and exact voice production remain to be chosen. Captions, reduced-flash/haptic settings and alternate cues preserve essential information.
